@startuml offline-sync
title Offline editing and sync

actor User
participant TodoStore
participant LocalDatabase
participant SyncCoordinator
participant SyncEngine
participant API

User -> TodoStore : add or edit a task
TodoStore -> LocalDatabase : apply change + enqueue operation
LocalDatabase --> User : UI updates immediately
TodoStore -> SyncCoordinator : request()

alt offline
  SyncCoordinator --> User : offline banner shows queued changes
  ... connection restored ...
  SyncCoordinator -> SyncEngine : sync()
else online
  SyncCoordinator -> SyncEngine : sync() after a short debounce
end

loop each queued operation, in order
  SyncEngine -> API : create (client id) / update / delete
  alt accepted
    SyncEngine -> LocalDatabase : remove operation
  else retryable (network, 5xx, 408, 429)
    SyncEngine --> SyncCoordinator : offline, keep the queue
  else rejected (other 4xx)
    SyncEngine -> LocalDatabase : remove operation
    SyncEngine --> SyncCoordinator : rejected + 1
  end
end

SyncEngine -> API : GET /lists, GET /tasks
SyncEngine -> LocalDatabase : replace local data, keeping entities with pending operations
SyncCoordinator --> User : banner reports changes the server refused
@enduml
